  "Tremor": "Draw an imaginary 1mm line that extends D3+3\" directy away from the caster in a direction chosen by the caster. This Magical Power targets every model (firend or foe) that lies under the line. Each target immediately suffers one Strength 4 hit and is knocked Prone; if the target was a Cavalry model, they will automatically count as suffering the Knocked Flying result on the Thrown Rider Chart. If a target is Engaged in Combat, then all other models in the same Combat are also considered to be a target - make sure to Pair Off Combats before working out which models are a target.\n\nModels with the Fly special rule can never be a target of this Magical Power under any circumstances.",
